  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Instructions\r\n\r\nUse **PAIR Programming with AI**:\r\n\r\n1. **_Prompt_** AI Tutor:\r\n\t* to generate 10 objects that fit the schema for `animals`.\r\n\t* to assist writing helper functions- `yesNo`, `getItemByIndex`, `updateFieldByIndex`, and `shiftItems`\r\n\t* to assist with render functions- `renderItem1` and `renderItem2`\r\n\r\n2. **Analyze** the varied outputs that AI Tutor produces and select the best solution.\r\n\r\n2. **Integrate** the code and test its functionality\r\n\r\n4. **Reflect** on the data that AI generated in the `reflection.md` file.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
